That was the reason for the con suite idea - an extra suite has no time 
limits (other than check-out time), and suites are cheaper than the 
conference room.

The conference room is needed if the annual meeting isn't over (because we 
all need to fit in one room for a meeting), or if the numbers who come to 
LogFest exceed what can fit in 1-2 suites.

